1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,880
 We all have present or future concerns or struggles we are trying to overcome.

2
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:12,960
 These may include questions or doubts.

3
00:00:12,960 --> 00:00:22,640
 Whatever they are, the way to overcome them is to get closer to our Savior, Jesus Christ.

4
00:00:22,640 --> 00:00:28,940
 Again and again He has taught us that He is the way.

5
00:00:28,940 --> 00:00:36,300
 on developing your faith in God and the mission of His Son, Jesus Christ.

6
00:00:36,300 --> 00:00:41,700
 Strong faith requires more than strong desire.

7
00:00:41,700 --> 00:00:52,700
 It means daily trying one step at a time with prayer and scriptural learning.

